    "name": "Red onions"
   },
   {
    "category": "vegetables",
    "description": "Chanterelles deserve a little attention. Clean gently, cook thoroughly, and keep the pan uncluttered. Butter and good bread are a sensible plan.",
    "id": "photo-product-154",
    "name": "Chanterelle mushrooms"
   },
   {
    "category": "vegetables",
    "description": "A hot pan is its friend. Brown the cut sides, season well, and stop before it gives up all its character.",
