    "name": "Zucchini"
   },
   {
    "category": "dairy",
    "description": "Rocky Butte cheese from Stepladder’s Cambria creamery. Put it beside bread and seasonal fruit, taste it on its own, and let the conversation find its way to the farm.",
    "id": "photo-product-033",
    "name": "Stepladder Rocky Butte cheese"
   },
   {
    "category": "dairy",
    "description": "Habanero Sierra Jack puts heat into the cheese drawer. A little goes a long way in a sandwich or a quesadilla. Taste first, then build dinner.",
    "id": "photo-product-132",
    "name": "Habanero Sierra Jack"
   },
   {
    "category": "pantry",
    "description": "Sweet Hickory BBQ sauce from Cal Poly. Brush it onto the food near the end of cooking, then let the grill do the last bit of work.",
    "id": "photo-product-011",
    "name": "Sweet Hickory BBQ sauce"
   },
   {
    "category": "pantry",
    "description": "Organic dark and robust maple syrup from a Wisconsin cooperative. This is a place for pancakes, yes, but also oatmeal and a warm slice of cornbread.",
    "id": "photo-product-052",
    "name": "Maple Valley dark and robust maple syrup"
   },
   {
