    "description": "California apricot preserves for buttered toast, a bowl of yogurt, or a plain cake that deserves a little company. Keep a jar where breakfast happens.",
    "id": "photo-product-107",
    "name": "California Apricot preserves"
   },
   {
    "category": "pantry",
    "description": "Cal Poly’s Mustang Kick belongs beside the grill. Start with a little, taste, and let the sauce earn its place on the next bite.",
